<title>UK: Aid carrier breaks down on passage to Iraq.</title>
<headline>Aid carrier breaks down on passage to Iraq.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Cyprus-flag bulker, carrying an aid cargo of wheat to Iraq, has generator problems and is due to be towed into Piraeus, Greece, Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The 26,958-dwt Adonis left Nantes, France on March 8.</p>
</text>
